Protect: Improve the Protect page. View the whole file a Scan threat was found in, then delete a stray file or restore a changed WordPress core file. The redesigned Firewall card shows 30-day and all-time block counts that refresh without a reload. Scan now says when a scan didn't complete or hasn't run yet, here and on the My Jetpack Protect card, drops a vulnerability once its plugin or theme is updated to the fixed version, and gives clearer advice and actions for each threat.
